      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Bend%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Donnaha, a National Register site near East Bend, was listed December 6 1978 and is one of North Carolina’s most significant Native American excavation sites.",
