      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Bend%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1914 the Yadkin County Agricultural Fair moved to East Bend and stayed there until 1978, making the town a regional fairground for six decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
